  "body": "Found while the v0.24.0 cut gate was red (run 44362577581). The only job that runs every heavy lane is the cut. A red heavy test stayed unseen on `main` and blocked the tag.\n\nWhat happens:\n- The quick tier selects test binaries from the diff. It does not run `--ignored` heavy lanes.\n- A PR that adds or changes a heavy pin is not required to run it. In PR #2035 the heavy pin was not run.\n\nExpected:\n- `xtask` maps a diff to the heavy binaries that it reaches, also through crate dependencies. A change in `motion` reaches the `app` heavy binaries.\n- One command runs those heavy tests in release mode, for example `cargo xtask gate heavy --diff`.\n- The review comment of a PR lists the heavy lanes that ran. The PR is not ready while a pinned heavy test is red.\n- The PR test runner (`pr-test.yml`) can run them for a collaborator's PR.\n- The full cut gate stays as the final check, because the tagged tree must equal the gated tree.\n\nMaintainer, 2026-11-18: \"yes file all 3 changes and move them to P4\".\n\nDone means: a PR that changes a crate with heavy lanes runs the reachable heavy tests before it is ready, and a test pins the diff-to-binary mapping.\n\nProcess change: yes.\n",
